TI  - Prevalencia de genes qnrB, qnrA y bla TEM en bacteriófagos atemperados de Escherichia coli aislados en agua residual y alcantarillas de rastros del Estado de México
TT  - Prevalence of the qnrB, qnrA and bla TEM genes in temperate bacteriophages of Escherichia coli isolated from wastewater and sewer water from slaughterhouses in the State of Mexico
