TI  - Trichoderma harzianum MTCC 5179 impacts the population and functional dynamics of microbial community in the rhizosphere of black pepper (Piper nigrum L.)
JO  - Brazilian Journal of Microbiology
J2  - Brazilian Journal of Microbiology
